24:55.720 --> 24:59.670
Hello? Says Hannah.

24:59.720 --> 25:02.670
She smiles at him.

25:02.720 --> 25:07.670
Can you do it again? Says Michael's mother.

25:07.720 --> 25:11.670
The baby laughs and claps his hands.

25:11.720 --> 25:12.670
Ah!

25:12.720 --> 25:18.670
I can! He says.

25:18.720 --> 25:21.670
And he stands up.

25:21.720 --> 25:26.670
Justin and Hannah walk away.

25:26.720 --> 25:30.670
Who's that? Justin asks.

25:30.720 --> 25:36.670
Now? Oh, a little baby. Hannah answers.

25:36.720 --> 25:42.720
